        Your bundle is now <strong>active</strong>. You can start requesting included services from your portal.
    </p>
    <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px;margin:0 0 16px 0;">
        <tr>
            <td style="padding:6px 12px 6px 0;color:#555;width:140px;">Bundle</td>
            <td style="padding:6px 0;font-weight:bold;"><t t-out="object.wink_source_product_id.name or ''">Bundle Name</t></td>
        </tr>
        <t t-if="object.wink_bundle_tier_id">
        <tr>
            <td style="padding:6px 12px 6px 0;color:#555;">Tier</td>
            <td style="padding:6px 0;"><t t-out="object.wink_bundle_tier_id.name or ''">Tier Name</t></td>
        </tr>
